ildren":[{"name":"finished","origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"color":0,"uuid":"584af1b9-b03a-5451-82ad-2fe5e788a368","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["afb0fce3-9558-5c7b-bd7c-2eb1a1959469","f56fa325-6ad5-5a1d-9ee9-9ae9e3b22dc5","9ac986d4-9445-573a-91c6-09a56fcfa936","e4c37390-fd81-5f63-b870-15480539cc76","8ed7a0d6-76d7-5d02-a883-69c620f8833d"]},{"name":"construction_0","origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"color":0,"uuid":"72926a4e-f36b-59cb-b73b-389b0f45347c","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":false,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["9f3175a6-2777-5226-9fb7-d1930e1ba003","29f21782-e0f8-5336-a8ef-6d51f08f524a","aaccdd77-ccb4-5374-b2e7-29a425a56d71","e07a8490-6dd4-52d9-ab52-8d45bd9fd02c","888a28ff-208e-57be-bd59-bc7393be839f"]},{"name":"construction_33","origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"color":0,"uuid":"eb03fb68-1855-5a9b-aeea-4e15666c0257","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":false,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["6c61b7fa-a4a0-5223-b9b3-afec1bd033f0","272a52ea-99e4-5844-b2df-9a7ca108b5c7","4dfd0b0c-174c-5248-a163-61dc4e30fea4","758d29ce-24c5-59b0-b428-aea1015b4594","6962f9a1-24c8-5f67-b396-57fad5fb6c6e"]},{"name":"construction_66","origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"color":0,"uuid":"70e6c59e-8f47-5a0a-b027-53cc0c7b3d16","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":false,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["93dd18e3-7550-5965-ba11-58c38ae9efb2","5cadc657-db9a-58bf-925b-06d353331459","73a9415f-bc16-5af1-974f-138a2290519f"]},{"name":"ruined","origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"color":0,"uuid":"cf7573af-6348-5da1-ba2c-87d6214176db","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":false,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["e56410c1-91d2-5696-8492-63552e88b50f","dd0be93d-fb90-53da-8de4-ab57081f8633","3b0d5bb1-f7f0-5c01-b009-de5cc9fcac4c","ca66a050-05b5-5e62-af6b-b607bd2e060e","e30764c6-c35e-564d-bd2f-db84a5855cda","7c9d0c03-af68-5f97-aa53-09e596b0e9c7","e38dcbf2-461b-5391-8665-73e70963643f"]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"ramp_lumber_1.png","name":"ramp_lumber_1.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":64,"height":64,"uv_width":64,"uv_height":64,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"e24bd664-9b10-5600-a12c-66fa5ea274af","relative_path":"ramp_lumber_1.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"# ramp_lumber_1\n\nLumber ramp, 1-step: one column wide, 1 column long (along +Z, climbing toward +Z), rising 4 u (1 terrain step of 11.25 cm).\n\n- Footprint: 1 x 1 columns (16 x 16 units, 0.45 x 0.45 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -8..8, y -4..4, z -8..9 units.\n- Texture: 64 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 5, construction_0 5, construction_33 5, construction_66 3, ruined 7 (21 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- ramp wedge: 16 x 4 x 16 (walkable slope 14.0 degrees), centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `ramp_lumber_1_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `ramp_lumber_1_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_ramp_lumber_1` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n"}